{
 "id": "continuous_pose",
 "version": "1.0.0",
 "depends_on": [
  "shape_decode_loop"
 ],
 "description": "CONTINUOUS POSE (FRONTIER rung T1): real-angle rotation as a cross-frame generator (Rotate, continuous theta) rendered to the stepped integer lattice, recognition decided by the held continuous verdict PointSetDist over a discrete-codebook proposal (bins propose, continuous decides). Two rules cp_recognize / cp_refuse, gated on the NEW flag agent.cont_pose (OFF by default -> committed bench byte-identical). NO new Rust. The identifiability bound falls out of observational resolution (VISION_CONTINUOUS_POSE_RESULTS.md).",
 "microtheory": "vision",
 "nodes": [],
 "edges": [],
 "productions": [],
 "rules": [
  {
   "name": "cp_recognize",
   "comment": "CONTINUOUS POSE (flag cont_pose==1). bins-propose / continuous-decides: the discrete similarity codebook (ShapeSignature nodes, each carrying a centroid-centred dense point set in the 'points' attr) proposes the identity set; the continuous verdict RENDERS each candidate at continuous theta (Rotate -- the cross-frame generator carrying the real angle as a Float, NEVER an in-frame coordinate) over the angle grid 'cp_angles' and DECIDES by the held PointSetDist (Modified Hausdorff). covered_by = Argmin over candidates of MinOver over angles of PointSetDist(render, obs.points); recognized iff the winner residual <= sqrt(2)/2 -- the unit lattice's half-diagonal = the maximum possible rounding-MHD, a FALLS-OUT bound (not a tuned constant, VISION_PROTOCOL sec 13). Fires only on status==cp_decoded (a marker the world adapter sets), so with cont_pose absent NEITHER this nor cp_refuse fires and the sd loop is byte-identical. No new Rust: Rotate/PointSetDist/MapList/MinOver/Argmin/NodesOfType/Attr all pre-exist (VISION_CONTINUOUS_POSE_PREREG.md sec 0).",
   "match_type": "Observation",
   "match": [
    [
     "ag",
     "observed",
     "obs"
    ]
   ],
   "where": {
    "type": "And",
    "items": [
     {
      "type": "Eq",
      "a": {
       "type": "Attr",
       "node": {
        "type": "Var",
        "name": "ag"
       },
       "key": "cont_pose"
      },
      "b": {
       "type": "Lit",
       "value": 1
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "Eq",
      "a": {
       "type": "Attr",
       "node": {
        "type": "Var",
        "name": "obs"
       },
       "key": "status"
      },
      "b": {
       "type": "Lit",
       "value": "cp_decoded"
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "Lte",
      "a": {
       "type": "MinOver",
       "source": {
        "type": "NodesOfType",
        "node_type": "ShapeSignature"
       },
       "var_name": "c",
       "value": {
        "type": "MinOver",
        "source": {
         "type": "Attr",
         "node": {
          "type": "Var",
          "name": "ag"
         },
         "key": "cp_angles"
        },
        "var_name": "t",
        "value": {
         "type": "PointSetDist",
         "a": {
          "type": "MapList",
          "source": {
           "type": "Attr",
           "node": {
            "type": "Var",
            "name": "c"
           },
           "key": "points"
          },
          "var_name": "p",
          "value": {
           "type": "Rotate",
           "vec": {
            "type": "Var",
            "name": "p"
           },
           "angle": {
            "type": "Var",
            "name": "t"
           }
          }
         },
         "b": {
          "type": "Attr",
          "node": {
           "type": "Var",
           "name": "obs"
          },
          "key": "points"
         }
        },
        "default": null
       },
       "default": null
      },
      "b": {
       "type": "Div",
       "a": {
        "type": "Sqrt",
        "arg": {
         "type": "Lit",
         "value": 2
        }
       },
       "b": {
        "type": "Lit",
        "value": 2
       }
      }
     }
    ]
   },
   "effects": [
    [
     "set_attr",
     "obs",
     "covered_by",
     {
      "__term__": {
       "type": "Attr",
       "node": {
        "type": "Argmin",
        "source": {
         "type": "NodesOfType",
         "node_type": "ShapeSignature"
        },
        "var_name": "c",
        "value": {
         "type": "MinOver",
         "source": {
          "type": "Attr",
          "node": {
           "type": "Var",
           "name": "ag"
          },
          "key": "cp_angles"
         },
         "var_name": "t",
         "value": {
          "type": "PointSetDist",
          "a": {
           "type": "MapList",
           "source": {
            "type": "Attr",
            "node": {
             "type": "Var",
             "name": "c"
            },
            "key": "points"
           },
           "var_name": "p",
           "value": {
            "type": "Rotate",
            "vec": {
             "type": "Var",
             "name": "p"
            },
            "angle": {
             "type": "Var",
             "name": "t"
            }
           }
          },
          "b": {
           "type": "Attr",
           "node": {
            "type": "Var",
            "name": "obs"
           },
           "key": "points"
          }
         },
         "default": null
        },
        "default": null
       },
       "key": "name"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     "set_attr",
     "obs",
     "status",
     "recognized_continuous"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "name": "cp_refuse",
   "comment": "The REFUSE branch of CONTINUOUS POSE (flag cont_pose==1). Fires when the winner residual EXCEEDS sqrt(2)/2 (the rounding floor) -- no candidate, at any theta in cp_angles, renders to within the lattice half-diagonal of the observation: it is a rotation of NO held object (noise / novel). Sets status=cp_refused (honest refuse), leaving covered_by ABSENT. Mutually exclusive with cp_recognize by the Lte / Not(Lte) split on the same min-residual term.",
   "match_type": "Observation",
   "match": [
    [
     "ag",
     "observed",
     "obs"
    ]
   ],
   "where": {
    "type": "And",
    "items": [
     {
      "type": "Eq",
      "a": {
       "type": "Attr",
       "node": {
        "type": "Var",
        "name": "ag"
       },
       "key": "cont_pose"
      },
      "b": {
       "type": "Lit",
       "value": 1
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "Eq",
      "a": {
       "type": "Attr",
       "node": {
        "type": "Var",
        "name": "obs"
       },
       "key": "status"
      },
      "b": {
       "type": "Lit",
       "value": "cp_decoded"
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "Not",
      "arg": {
       "type": "Lte",
       "a": {
        "type": "MinOver",
        "source": {
         "type": "NodesOfType",
         "node_type": "ShapeSignature"
        },
        "var_name": "c",
        "value": {
         "type": "MinOver",
         "source": {
          "type": "Attr",
          "node": {
           "type": "Var",
           "name": "ag"
          },
          "key": "cp_angles"
         },
         "var_name": "t",
         "value": {
          "type": "PointSetDist",
          "a": {
           "type": "MapList",
           "source": {
            "type": "Attr",
            "node": {
             "type": "Var",
             "name": "c"
            },
            "key": "points"
           },
           "var_name": "p",
           "value": {
            "type": "Rotate",
            "vec": {
             "type": "Var",
             "name": "p"
            },
            "angle": {
             "type": "Var",
             "name": "t"
            }
           }
          },
          "b": {
           "type": "Attr",
           "node": {
            "type": "Var",
            "name": "obs"
           },
           "key": "points"
          }
         },
         "default": null
        },
        "default": null
       },
       "b": {
        "type": "Div",
        "a": {
         "type": "Sqrt",
         "arg": {
          "type": "Lit",
          "value": 2
         }
        },
        "b": {
         "type": "Lit",
         "value": 2
        }
       }
      }
     }
    ]
   },
   "effects": [
    [
     "set_attr",
     "obs",
     "status",
     "cp_refused"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
}